Nova-App: NovaOS 2
Nova-News: NovaOS 2: Nova Disk (Festplattenanalyse und Datenrettung), neuer Nova Store, Design „Nebula“, neuer Start- und Anmeldebildschirm
Nova-News-En: NovaOS 2: Nova Disk (disk analysis and file rescue), new Nova Store, "Nebula" design, new start and login screen
Description: NovaOS 2 "Nebula"
 Turns NovaOS into NovaOS 2: the new apps and the new look. Installed with
 "NovaOS 2 holen" in Software-Update (at the next restart).
  * Nova Disk: disk analysis and file rescue
  * the new Nova Store (app of the day, category tiles)
  * wallpaper "Nebula", boot screen and login screen of NovaOS 2
 Removing this package goes back to the NovaOS 1 look; the apps stay.
